This byte-identical test artifact keeps the golden token-vector gate runnable
offline. Production measurement does not resolve this directory implicitly;
install the artifact explicitly with `go run ./cmd/retrieval-eval
-setup-tokenizer -tokenizer-local internal/eval/tokenizer/testdata/artifact` or
use the HTTPS acquisition path without `-tokenizer-local`.
